amily:나눔고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:나눔고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\">교육</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:나눔고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\">컨설팅</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:나눔고딕;font-family:나눔고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:나눔고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼고딕;font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼고딕;font-size:11.0pt;color:#333333;\">야간학과</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#ff0000;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#ff0000;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-weight:bold;color:#333333;\">신고 기한</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2021.07.19 ~ 08.13.(</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;color:#333333;\">금</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;color:#333333;\">까지</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-weight:bold;color:#333333;\">신고 절차</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;color:#333333;\">인터넷신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;color:#333333;\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-ascii-font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;color:#315f97;\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-family:한컴 소망 B;font-size:11.0pt;color:#315f97;\">우리대학 홈페이지 원스톱서비스 로그인 </span><span style=\"font-family:한컴 소망 B;mso-fareast-font-fami